<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">conditions</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">conditions</ansi> command lists your current afflictions
and debuffs.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Notable Conditions ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="stat">Broken Limb:</ansi>
    A limb broken during a cripple submission. Reduces your
    combat effectiveness for an extended period. Recovers
    naturally over time — about an hour of play. Cannot be
    removed early by normal healing or dispel effects.
    See <ansi fg="command">help submission</ansi>.

  <ansi fg="stat">Prone:</ansi>
    On the ground, face-down. Penalises attacks and leaves you
    more vulnerable to incoming hits. Use <ansi fg="command">stand</ansi>
    to get up. See <ansi fg="command">help prone</ansi>.

  <ansi fg="stat">Stunned:</ansi>
    A brief stagger — lasts one round and clears automatically.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help submission</ansi>,
  <ansi fg="command">help prone</ansi>
